sage here is saved in the workspace record, so nothing else to do on my side.\"\n\nHer message was already saved in the workspace record automatically, so nothing else was needed. One thing you may want to check: a September 2025 note in the workspace record says Brackenwater moved to Marcus Lindqvist on 15 Sept 2025. That may just be out of date, so I didn't raise it in the channel.\n```","id":3,"source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"marcus-lindqvist"}
